const enDescription = "Anthropic's $10B Volta deal (133MW Norway + Bitdeer + Nvidia Vera Rubin): what changes for Claude API pricing. Dev playbook inside.";
const zhTitle = "Anthropic 与 Volta 100 亿美元算力协议：Claude API 价格会涨吗？";
const zhDescription = "Anthropic 与 Volta 签 100 亿美元 6 年算力合同：133MW 挪威 + Bitdeer + Nvidia Vera Rubin。对 Claude API 定价意味着什么？开发者三步实操。";
